JellyBox vendors common/sizing.glsl and common/utils.glsl, plus the 128x128
noise texture at assets/images/paper_noise.png, from the paper_shaders Flutter
package (https://github.com/AndreFrelicot/paper-shaders-flutter), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE next to this file).

fluid.frag is a JellyBox modification of that package's warp.frag (the Paper
Shaders "warp" effect) that reads a pointer flow map. flow.frag is JellyBox
code modelled on the Flowmap extra of ogl (https://github.com/oframe/ogl,
MIT License).

